{"text": "It is crucial to recognize. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That boredom can give rise to harmful emotions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Such as depression, despair, and irritation. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If not adequately addressed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When we believe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That the only way to be happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is by searching for fun activities. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then we become dependent on those activities. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And negative thoughts and emotions arise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is suggested that Idle time is the devils workshop implies. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That those with too much time on their hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> May fill that time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With troubling thoughts and behavior. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The balance is to not see it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As idle time, wasted time, or boredom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But rather as a perfect time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For self improvement, self identification, and positive reflection time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Reflecting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just how lucky are we. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To be bored. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Boredom does not exist. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the presence of danger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As it is only an indulgence pastime in a safe zone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Boredom can be perceived. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As a luxury that typically manifests in safe and inactive situations. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Providing an occasion to appreciate and comprehend the environment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In hazardous circumstances. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The luxury of boredom is unavailable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Thus. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is paramount. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To utilize idle moments. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For profound self reflection. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It represents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> An occasion to listen, observe, and appreciate before expressin